{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51612","headline":"采春子 · 冯延巳","name":"采春子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"樱桃谢了梨花发，红白相催。\n燕子归来，几处香风绿户开。\n人生乐事知多少，且酌金杯。\n管咽弦哀，慢引萧娘舞袖回。\n（《万代诗余》）（〖1〗见《历代诗余》卷十，调属《采桑子》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"冯延巳","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51612.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51612","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}